    "source_file": "call_003.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 49.0,
    "end_time": 56.0,
    "text": "The last time I talked to you that night, all sorts of really bad things happened to Darcy."
  },
  {
    "source_file": "call_003.wav",
    "speaker_id": "B",
    "start_time": 57.0,
    "end_time": 66.0,
    "text": "People, the next couple of days people were like, like she saw a man in the window jacking off,"
